rdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"QA Full Task\\\" complete button disabled=true while prereq \\\"Buy groceries\\\" incomplete. After completing \\\"Buy groceries\\\", its complete button became disabled=false and the card label changed to \\\"1 prerequisite completed\\\". Still-blocked tasks (Submit final report, Complete tax filing, QA Edited Task) remain disabled=true.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Chain QA Edited Task -> QA Full Task -> Buy groceries. Editing \\\"Buy groceries\\\" offers only: Review project proposal, Schedule dentist appointment, Complete tax filing, Organize desk, Reply to client emails, Submit final report — itself, direct dependent (QA Full Task) and indirect dependent (QA Edited Task) are omitted. Editing \\\"Review project proposal\\\" likewise omitted its dependents Complete tax filing and Submit final report.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With empty title, \\\"Create Task\\\" button disabled=true; after typing whitespace-only \\\"   \\\" it remained disabled=true. Active count stayed 5.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"\\\"Buy groceries\\\" stayed in the Completed view with all data intact (\\\"Buy groceries / Low / Milk, eggs, bread... / Tomorrow\\\"). Reopening \\\"Organize desk\\\" from the completed view moved it back to Active (counts 5a/3c -> 6a/2c), confirming completed tasks persist until reopened or deleted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reopening a prerequisite leaves the dependent task simultaneously completed and blocked\", \"actual\": \"Setup: \\\"Buy groceries\\\" completed, then dependent \\\"QA Full Task\\\" completed (counts 4 active, 4 completed state). Reopening \\\"Buy groceries\\\" from the Completed view was allowed with no warning, confirmation or toast. Result: counts \\\"6 active, 2 completed\\\"; the Completed view still lists \\\"QA Full Task\\\" and its card now reads 'QA Full Task | High | QA description text | Sep 5 | Prerequisite \\\"Buy groceries\\\" incomplete' — it is completed and blocked at the same time. The system neither prevented the reopen nor returned the dependent to an incomplete state.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashed SVG connectors (stroke-dasharray 6px,4px) are Radix tooltip triggers. Hovering one opens tooltip \\\"Dependency Chain / Complete tax filing pending / Review project proposal pending\\\" (data-state -> delayed-open).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Hovering the warning badge shows a tooltip: single-prereq case -> \\\"Dependency Chain / Review project proposal / pending\\\"; multi-prereq case (Submit final report) -> \\\"Dependency Chain / Review project proposal pending / Complete tax filing pending\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Every card shows title + priority badge (e.g. \\\"Buy groceries / Low\\\"). Description and deadline render only when supplied (\\\"Organize desk / Low\\\" has neither; \\\"QA Full Task / High / QA description text / Sep 5\\\"). Blocked cards add the amber prerequisite warning. Completed tasks render with line-through + text-muted-foreground.\"}]}"
